      "kind": "faq",
      "heading": "Questions, answered",
      "html": "<h3>What does an ISO 14001 internal audit cover?</h3><p>It checks your environmental management system against ISO 14001:2015. That means the aspects and impacts register, the legal register and compliance check, objectives and targets, operational controls, and whether the last audit's actions were closed. You grade findings as conformities, observations or nonconformities.</p><h3>Is an internal audit required by ISO 14001?</h3><p>Yes. ISO 14001:2015 says you audit at planned intervals. The programme is itself audited, so the certification body will sample your internal audit records.</p><h3>What happens to a nonconformity?</h3><p>Grade it. Find the root cause. Give it an owner and a due date. Close it with proof. The next audit checks it. One that is raised and forgotten comes back as a repeat finding.</p><h3>Can I run an ISO 14001 audit in WhatsApp?</h3><p>Yes. Each check arrives in your WhatsApp chat. You answer by text, voice note or photo. When you say done, Quickler writes the audit report. No new app. No login.</p><h3>Related guides</h3><ul><li><a href=\"/pages/environmental-inspection-software-uk.html\">Environmental inspection software</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/environmental-permit-compliance-audit-uk.html\">Environmental permit compliance audit</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/spill-response-inspection-report-uk.html\">Spill response inspection report</a></li></ul>"
